# Cererile pentru Laboratorul 4.
# In IntelliJ: apasati sageata verde din stanga fiecarei cereri.
# Raspunsul (status, headere, JSON) apare in fereastra de jos.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Exercitiul 1 - Toate filmele
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies

### Exercitiul 1 - Un singur film
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1

### Exercitiul 1 - Un film care nu exista (ce status primim?)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/99

### Exercitiul 1 - Filtrare dupa gen
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/movies?genre=Sci-Fi

### Exercitiul 2 - Adauga un film (rulati de doua ori: ce se intampla?)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Inside Out 2",
  "genre": "Animation",
  "price": 25
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Modifica filmul 1 (rulati de doua ori: ce se intampla?)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Dune: Part Two",
  "genre": "Sci-Fi",
  "price": 40
}

### Exercitiul 2 - Sterge filmul 3
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/3

### Exercitiul 3 - Film invalid (fara titlu, pret 0)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "genre": "Drama",
  "price": 0
}

### Exercitiul 3 - Modifica un film care nu exista
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/99
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Nu exista",
  "genre": "Drama",
  "price": 20
}

### Exercitiul 3 - Sterge un film care nu exista
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/movies/99

### Bonus - Ce metode accepta resursa? (uitati-va la headerul Allow)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/api/movies

### Bonus - HEAD: aceleasi headere ca GET, fara body
HEAD {{baseUrl}}/api/movies
